                            {
                                "example_id": "c1a0f59d-d412-4a6f-a89c-da4add6fb4ea",
                                "sense_id": "1da0d31f-b705-3e3b-a214-2d4fbbe94449",
                                "text": "— If you can’t find your pencils, maybe someone stole them.\n— For what sia?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6a4c097b-a6e0-4eb5-b69a-54a91892ee01",
                                "sense_id": "1da0d31f-b705-3e3b-a214-2d4fbbe94449",
                                "text": "[…] Really disappointed siah […] The damage is done and no explanation will be accepted...... damn stupid!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3200fffa-e7b7-4057-ae30-d2aaffc7a1c2",
                                "sense_id": "1da0d31f-b705-3e3b-a214-2d4fbbe94449",
                                "text": "Wah. Really damn shag [exhausting] sia, everyday. But I'm really glad to be able to contribute😄"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e892368b-5835-4000-b20b-27dce8954a94",
                                "sense_id": "1da0d31f-b705-3e3b-a214-2d4fbbe94449",
                                "text": "As soon as the sentence was handed down, I saw my Mum crying. I was given 5 minutes to talk to them and after that, I thought to myself what the fuck am I going to do sia! […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db0554b5-e64c-4e83-9d95-83fb363396b9",
                                "sense_id": "1da0d31f-b705-3e3b-a214-2d4fbbe94449",
                                "text": "And we fucking panic sia. We kept saying, \"No no no!\" And they kept shouting […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
